#: ../../technical/articles/194-facturae-3-2-2-enumerations-and-total-composition.md:12
msgid ""
"This three-file data bundle is a compact, sourced reference for Facturae "
"3.2.2. All three JSON documents were parsed in full. The country-code "
"enumeration has 235 entries with no duplicates; the invoice-class "
"enumeration has six code/label pairs in English and Spanish; and the "
"invoice-totals composition has an ordered list of 19 elements, each "
"marked required or optional and accompanied by schema documentation. The "
"provenance objects identify the published Facturae 3.2.2 XML source, "
"byte/hash details, extraction encoding, and retrieval dates in August "
"2026."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/194-facturae-3-2-2-enumerations-and-total-composition.md:14
msgid ""
"The data supports document parsing or validation by supplying closed "
"codes and expected element order. The InvoiceTotals documentation also "
"records arithmetic annotations—for example, gross amount before taxes is "
"gross less total discounts plus total surcharges, and invoice total adds "
"output taxes and subtracts withheld taxes. These are schema-derived "
"documentation strings; the files do not implement or validate arithmetic."
" The source schema remains the authority, and this bounded review does "
"not establish that every code, field, or formula is consumed correctly by"
" a parser."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/194-facturae-3-2-2-enumerations-and-total-composition.md:16
msgid ""
"This is declarative JSON only, with no executable code or taxpayer "
"records. Provenance checks and unique counts establish internal shape, "
"not that the archived schema remains the latest Facturae release. No "
"security concern is evident in these files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../technical/articles/194-facturae-3-2-2-enumerations-and-total-composition.md:18
msgid "Complete assigned-file coverage"
msgstr "Cobertura completa de los archivos asignados"

